@startuml
title Diagrama de Despliegue - Infraestructura IOIO

!define CLIENT_COLOR #E3F2FD
!define SERVER_COLOR #F3E5F5
!define DB_COLOR #E8F5E9
!define CLOUD_COLOR #FFF9C4

node "Cliente (Browser)" <<device>> CLIENT_COLOR {
    artifact "React Application" {
        component [HTML/CSS/JS Bundle]
        component [TailwindCSS Styles]
        component [React Components]
        component [Zustand Store]
    }
    
    artifact "Build Tool" {
        component [Vite v5.0.8]
    }
}

node "Servidor Web" <<web server>> SERVER_COLOR {
    component [Nginx] {
        [Reverse Proxy]
        [Static File Server]
        [SSL/TLS Termination]
    }
}

node "Servidor de Aplicación" <<application server>> SERVER_COLOR {
    component [Node.js Runtime] {
        [Express.js v4.x]
        [API REST Endpoints]
        [Middleware Stack]
    }
    
    artifact "Backend Application" {
        [Controllers]
        [Use Cases]
        [Repositories]
        [Services]
    }
    
    folder "Uploads Directory" {
        file [Product Images]
        file [Banner Images]
        file [Event Images]
    }
}

node "Servidor de Base de Datos" <<database server>> DB_COLOR {
    database "PostgreSQL" {
        [users]
        [products]
        [orders]
        [order_items]
        [cart_items]
        [categories]
        [banners]
        [events]
        [experiments]
        [custom_pages]
    }
    
    component [Connection Pool] {
        [pg Pool Manager]
    }
}

cloud "CDN / File Storage" CLOUD_COLOR {
    storage [Static Assets]
    storage [Product Images]
    storage [Media Files]
}

cloud "Payment Services" CLOUD_COLOR {
    component [MercadoPago API] {
        [Payment Gateway]
        [Webhook Receiver]
    }
}

cloud "Blockchain Networks" CLOUD_COLOR {
    component [Bitcoin Network] {
        [BTC Wallet]
        [Transaction Monitor]
    }
    
    component [Ethereum Network] {
        [ETH Wallet]
        [Transaction Monitor]
    }
}

cloud "Infrastructure as Code" {
    component [Terraform] {
        [AWS/Cloud Provider]
        [Infrastructure Config]
    }
}

' Client to Web Server
[React Application] --> [Nginx] : HTTPS (443)\nHTTP/2

' Web Server to App Server
[Nginx] --> [Express.js v4.x] : HTTP (5000)\nReverse Proxy

' Web Server to CDN
[Nginx] --> [Static Assets] : HTTPS\nStatic Files

' App Server to Database
[Express.js v4.x] --> [Connection Pool] : TCP (5432)\nPostgreSQL Protocol
[Connection Pool] --> [PostgreSQL]

' App Server to File Storage
[Backend Application] --> [Uploads Directory] : File I/O
[Nginx] --> [Uploads Directory] : Serve /uploads

' App Server to External Services
[Backend Application] --> [MercadoPago API] : HTTPS\nREST API
[Backend Application] --> [Bitcoin Network] : RPC\nJSON-RPC
[Backend Application] --> [Ethereum Network] : RPC\nJSON-RPC

' Infrastructure
[Terraform] ..> [Servidor Web] : provisions
[Terraform] ..> [Servidor de Aplicación] : provisions
[Terraform] ..> [Servidor de Base de Datos] : provisions

note right of [Nginx]
  **Configuration:**
  - Port: 80, 443
  - SSL/TLS enabled
  - Gzip compression
  - Rate limiting
  - CORS headers
  
  **Routes:**
  - / → React SPA
  - /api → Backend proxy
  - /uploads → Static files
end note

note right of [Express.js v4.x]
  **Configuration:**
  - Port: 5000
  - Environment: production
  - Trust proxy: enabled
  
  **Middleware:**
  - helmet (security)
  - cors
  - rate-limit (200/min)
  - body-parser
  - JWT authentication
end note

note right of [PostgreSQL]
  **Configuration:**
  - Port: 5432
  - Version: 14+
  - Connection pool: 20 max
  
  **Features:**
  - Transactions (ACID)
  - Foreign keys
  - Indexes on key columns
  - JSON/JSONB support
end note

note bottom of [MercadoPago API]
  **Integration:**
  - Chilean Peso (CLP)
  - Webhook notifications
  - Payment preferences
  - 12 installments support
end note

note as DeploymentNote
  **Deployment Process:**
  1. Frontend: Vite build → Static files
  2. Backend: Node.js process (PM2/systemd)
  3. Database: PostgreSQL migrations
  4. Infrastructure: Terraform apply
  
  **Environment Variables:**
  - VITE_API_URL (frontend)
  - DATABASE_URL (backend)
  - JWT_SECRET (backend)
  - MERCADOPAGO_ACCESS_TOKEN (backend)
  - BTC_WALLET_ADDRESS (backend)
  - ETH_WALLET_ADDRESS (backend)
end note

@enduml
